<title>UK: Smithkline Beecham 96 pretax up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Smithkline Beecham 96 pretax up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		37.9		   vs    35.6</p>
<p> Total div (pence)	17.85		  vs    14.3</p>
<p> Pretax		  1,545.00		  vs 1,361</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 1,540 and 1,590 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
